## 数据结构

### 引用和安全深度访问

```perl
use v5.36;

# Hash and array references
my $config = {
    database => {
        host => 'localhost',
        port => 5432,
        options => ['utf8', 'sslmode=require'],
    },
};

# Safe deep access (returns undef if any level missing)
